&lt;p&gt;At Coeo, we believe data has the power to transform organizations. As one of the UK&#39;s leading Microsoft Data &amp;amp; AI consultancies, we help our clients unlock the full value of their data by combining deep technical expertise with business-focused consulting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is simple: &lt;strong&gt;to help our clients predict their future&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 18 years, we&#39;ve specialized exclusively in the Microsoft ecosystem, helping organizations modernize their data platforms, harness the power of analytics and AI, and make better decisions faster. Today, we&#39;re at the forefront of delivering solutions built on Microsoft Fabric, Azure, Databricks, Power BI and AI technologies, enabling our clients to turn data into a genuine competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Coeo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re more than just technology specialists. We&#39;re trusted advisors, architects, engineers and consultants who work closely with our clients to solve complex business challenges and deliver measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our expertise spans:&lt;/p&gt;
