&lt;li&gt;Facilitate client workshops, discovery sessions and technical engagements, translating business requirements into practical data and analytics solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design scalable, secure and well-governed data platform architectures that align with client objectives and industry best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership throughout project delivery, ensuring solutions meet agreed quality, performance and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
