&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support consultants, promoting engineering excellence, knowledge sharing and continuous improvement across delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce high-quality technical documentation, solution designs and client-facing deliverables to support successful project outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage technical risks, dependencies and delivery challenges, working with clients and project teams to ensure successful implementation and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
