&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pinterest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people around the world come to our platform to find creative ideas, dream about new possibilities and plan for memories that will last a lifetime. At Pinterest, we’re on a mission to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love, and that starts with the people behind the product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover a career where you ignite innovation for millions, transform passion into growth opportunities, celebrate each other’s unique experiences and embrace the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-life/pinflex/&quot;&gt;flexibility&lt;/a&gt; to do your best work. Creating a career you love? It’s Possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Pinterest, AI isn&#39;t just a feature, it&#39;s a powerful partner that augments our creativity and amplifies our impact, and we’re looking for candidates who are excited to be a part of that. To get a complete picture of your experience and abilities, we’ll explore your foundational skills and how you collaborate with AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our interview process, what matters most is that you can always explain your approach, showing us not just what you know, but how you think. You can read more about our AI interview philosophy and how we use AI in our recruiting process &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/our-philosophy-on-ai-in-hiring/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Director, Retail, UK to lead our monetisation efforts for the vertical. Reporting to the UK Managing Director, you&#39;ll be responsible for building Pinterest’s Retail business in one of EMEA’s largest markets. You will be working closely with cross-functional partners to drive business results for our clients while delivering growth. You will be managing a team of senior sellers and be part of the UK Senior Leadership Team. You will be representing Pinterest externally and be our voice in the industry on relevant topics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time position based in the UK and our office is in London.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our sales strategy and execution for Retail in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop market and competitive assessments to identify and drive new opportunities for Pinterest in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on established relationships and develop new relationships with partners’ executive and operational teams and industry associations in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close strategic partnerships and scale revenue with Retail advertisers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive sales operational excellence across key metrics and leading sales indicators according to the annual and quarterly business plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the UK Retail team by building, training and motivating a high performing, diverse sales team based on an inclusive, positive culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales Operations and Measurement teams to analyse data trends and client performance, and scale shared learnings and best practices to grow clients’ business through Pinterest solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As part of our UK leadership team, contribute to the success of the country through collaborating across verticals and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the thoughtful use of AI-driven tools and insights to improve sales effectiveness, client strategy, and team productivity across the Retail business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and strengthen strategic relationships with key media agencies and agency stakeholders to unlock growth opportunities, influence planning, and drive stronger outcomes for clients and Pinterest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an external spokesperson and champion our value proposition in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15 or more years of experience in the digital media industry, with 7 or more years of management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong team player with experience in successfully leading marketing or sales teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with executive level business and marketing leaders within client organisations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established industry leader with strong network amongst Retail companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of performance, data, and measurement landscapes, with demonstrated experience using data and trends to develop winning strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong focus on operational excellence by having introduced new performance measures, processes, and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of how AI is shaping digital advertising, retail marketing, and sales leadership, and can translate that knowledge into practical business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to clearly articulate Pinterest’s role across the full marketing funnel—awareness, consideration, and conversion—with a particular emphasis on lower-funnel performance, measurable business outcomes, and the unique impact of Pinterest’s visual search and discovery capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding go-to-market strategy and operational rigor to drive the successful execution of the sales business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills that inspire, drive urgency and challenge sales teams to think big and drive transformational thinking to advance team performance, health, and an inclusive culture.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional partnership to drive discussions with the product and engineering teams driving alignment. Translating business needs into the roadmap.&amp;nbsp; Have opinions about the technology trade-offs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong influencing skills to build and direct sales priorities and decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding presentation and communication skills with the ability to translate insights, product information, and data into key client objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to excel in a growth environment and incubating new businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of the digital measurement landscape, including MTA &amp;amp; MMM, and how to apply these frameworks to evaluate and optimise campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using or leading teams that use AI-powered tools for forecasting, client planning, workflow efficiency, or insight generation is a strong advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field such as Marketing, Business or Advertising, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for Pinterest and its mission&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt; PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Requirement Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We let the type of work you do guide the collaboration style. That means we&#39;re not always working in an office, but we continue to gather for key moments of collaboration and connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 2 times per week and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from our London office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AKEO&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Pinterest is an equal opportunity employer and makes employment decisions on the basis of merit. We want to have the best qualified people in every job. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, status as a protected veteran, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member) or any other consideration made unlawful by applicable federal, state or local laws. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. If you require a medical or religious accommodation during the job application process, please complete&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/sS24D4WboEKUZMQK6&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt; for support.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting this application, I certify that all information submitted in my application and throughout the hiring process is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that any false statement, omission, or misrepresentation may disqualify me from employment consideration or result in termination if discovered after hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team of Relationship Managers and become part of an impactful and dynamic environment. Our team plays a central role at Raisin, responsible for fostering partnerships with our platforms’ partner banks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Partnership Manager, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in driving Raisin&#39;s growth across Europe and the UK. Your primary mission is to cultivate and oversee daily interactions with Raisin&#39;s partner banks, and to lead or support managing key accounts. Beyond that, you&#39;ll spearhead the launch of new products,&amp;nbsp; integration of new banks into Raisin&#39;s and our B2B partners&#39; marketplaces, and improving their technical integration with us to ensure scalability and the growth of the banks’ assets under management and ultimately the Raisin platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our far-reaching impact and diverse stakeholders, we have a comprehensive view of platform-wide evolutions, and others depend on your ability to communicate these changes and their broader implications. We are ultimately accountable for owning and managing our partner banks, taking direct responsibility for the performance and reporting of those partners and bringing new savings products to the consumer market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To excel in this role, you should be adept at managing senior stakeholders, both internally and externally. We’re a high growth fintech business, so the ability to work on multiple relationships and ad-hoc projects concurrently is key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Partnership Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as a commercial lead and strategic advisor for our portfolio of partner banks in the UK and Europe. Moving beyond traditional relationship management, this role requires a consultative, balance-sheet-first mindse&lt;strong&gt;t&lt;/strong&gt; to help executive banking leadership solve liquidity, capital, and deposit-funding challenges using Raisin&#39;s platform technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Advisory &amp;amp; Partner Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary strategic contact for Treasury Heads, Chief Financial Officers, and C-suite banking executives, aligning Raisin&#39;s platform capabilities with their balance sheet, liquidity, and cost-of-funding objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Portfolio Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively structure, negotiate, and execute commercial growth strategies to scale partner Assets Under Management (AUM) and launch new deposit product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex, multi-stakeholder workstreams across internal cross-functional teams (Solutions Engineering, Legal, Compliance, Operations) to ensure seamless bank onboarding and technical integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Market Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive priority commercial initiatives across the UK and EEA markets, identifying opportunities to launch adjacent financial products and expand strategic partner coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Positioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish yourself as a trusted commercial advisor to executive leadership across your assigned bank portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUM &amp;amp; Portfolio Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver measurable deposit growth by optimizing bank partner pricing, funding targets, and market positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flawless Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Successfully lead complex bank integration and product launch milestones on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Top-tier Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a related quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Background:&lt;/strong&gt; 3–6+ years of experience in Management Consulting&amp;nbsp;or Investment Banking&amp;nbsp;or Strategic Partnerships within a B2B Fintech/BaaS scale-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of bank balance sheets, deposit mechanics, regulatory frameworks, and commercial deal structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Communication &amp;amp; Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional capability to translate complex financial and technical concepts into structured executive presentations for bank leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Stakeholder Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record of leading complex, multi-variable projects autonomously in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with UK/EEA banking regulations (FCA, BaFin), liquidity coverage ratios (LCR), or BaaS/Open Banking infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transaction, M&amp;amp;A, treasury, or advisory experience working directly with UK and European retail or commercial banks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of £1,700 and 4 full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always hungry? Breakfast, snacks, daily fresh fruit and drinks are at your disposal around the clock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are hybrid working, we are in the office twice a week, giving the team the opportunity to collaborate and spend time together. Wednesday is our core day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer 28 days + Bank Holidays of holiday a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One day birthday leave to celebrate your birthday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer you a company stakeholder pension with a minimum employer contribution of 5%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to experience our annual retreats in exciting European cities and other team building events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Shape How the World Discovers Hospitality with OpenTable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Are you a strategic marketer who thrives at the intersection of high-impact brand media and performance growth? Do you want the agility, ownership, and speed of a tech startup, backed by the scale and resources of a global industry leader?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;With millions of diners, 70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A little about the role...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Senior Marketing Manager to lead upper-funnel brand media and help scale our growth across international markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You’ll take strategic ownership of international brand investment, shape channel strategies across Out-of-Home (OOH), Connected TV (CTV) and digital video, and play an important role in defining how we grow and reach diners internationally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role with plenty of scope to think big, test ideas and get hands-on with making them happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Why this role is unique;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Startup autonomy, enterprise scale: Build systems, test new channels and move quickly, while having the backing of world-class data, resources and an established global brand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;True end-to-end ownership: From building investment cases and managing agency relationships to designing lift studies and getting hands-on with execution, you’ll have real ownership of the outcome.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-functional influence: You’ll bring together media agencies, regional market leads, performance marketing, creative partners and adtech engineering teams to make sure everyone is moving in the same direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Room to grow: As our International Growth practice continues to scale, there’s an opportunity for your remit and leadership responsibilities to grow with it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;📈 What you’ll drive;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;International Brand Media Strategy: Own the end-to-end strategy, channel selection and investment allocation for upper-funnel activity across key international markets, including OOH, CTV and digital video.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Full-Funnel Growth: Connect brand media with performance channels, CRM, organic and social to create a seamless diner journey and maximise ROI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced Brand Measurement: Move beyond last-click attribution by establishing frameworks for lift studies, brand tracking and econometrics to better understand and optimise the impact of international investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Growth Systems: Partner with creative and engineering teams to build campaign infrastructure and explore how AI-powered tooling can help us move faster across markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Executive Leadership Alignment: Turn complex media and growth insights into clear strategies, business cases and roadmaps that help senior leaders make informed decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Test, Learn and Scale: Spot opportunities, test ideas quickly, learn from the results and scale what works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
