&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application/interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
